title: greeting
tags: root
---
Linzi: You've come far, wanderer. The Veiled Vale has use for those who persist. I can make this easier for you.
-> What do you want?
    <<jump offer>>
-> I don't need help.
    <<jump soft_warning>>
===
title: offer
---
Linzi: Only to guide you. The paths here are treacherous — they shift, they lie. Without someone who knows the Vale, you'll wander until you're hollow.
-> I'll take the offer.
    <<fire_event linzi_guide_accepted>>
    <<jump accept_guide>>
-> I'll find my own way.
    <<jump soft_warning>>
===
title: accept_guide
---
Linzi: Good. Stay close. Don't ask too many questions. The Vale rewards trust.
-> Lead on.
    <<stop>>
===
title: soft_warning
---
Linzi: Those who wander alone here tend to become... lost. Remember this choice. I'm always here when you reconsider.
-> I'll keep that in mind.
    <<stop>>
===